id: pm-brand-74ga
title: Keep published dependency updates in the generated changelog
description: "Fleet changelog standard: every pm-changelog invocation in package.json passes --dependency-updates so regeneration keeps published dependency bullets. pm-brand's squash-merge subjects do not match the Dependabot conventional-commit shape, so no bullets are restored today; the flag keeps future Dependabot-shaped merges in the generated changelog."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
