comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-24T01:25:41.887Z",codex-agent,"Added --dependency-updates to the changelog, changelog:full, changelog:check and release:notes package scripts and regenerated with fetched tags. Restored 0 dependency bullets versus main: this package's squash-merge subjects do not match the Dependabot conventional-commit shape, so its published changelog carries no dependency bullets to keep. The flag keeps future Dependabot-shaped merges in the generated changelog. Revert proof: removing only the flag from the package scripts makes test/release-workflow.test.ts fail 1 of 8 tests; restoring the flag passes 8 of 8."
  "2026-11-24T05:45:35.159Z",codex-agent,"Resumed the existing branch and verified that all four changelog scripts pass the dependency flag. Rechecking the regression, generated output, and package gates."
  "2026-11-24T05:49:06.267Z",codex-agent,"Kept the existing script, changelog, and tracker changes and strengthened the regression to cover each entry point and any additional direct invocation. Full regeneration restored 0 dependency bullets versus main and omitted 0 published bullets. Removing only the flag from each of the four package scripts separately failed the assertion for that script; the focused regression passed after restoration. Typecheck, lint, build, and 73 focused tests passed."
